{
 "id": "fox-running-shine",
 "name": "Running shine",
 "part": "neutral",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "Run at a moving opponent and shine it without stopping",
 "why": "The shine comes out of a run on the frame it is pressed and hits on that frame: Fox can run straight at an opponent that is dashing about or jumping and shine it before it reacts. It is his fastest way to start a combo from neutral.",
 "switch": "success",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Hold the stick toward the opponent to run, and press down and B as Fox reaches it. Do not stop first.",
  "expect": "A try begins with the shine and is judged at once: it hit, or it did not reach. In the second part the opponent dashes about and jumps: it does not attack.",
  "example": [
   {
    "stick": [
     1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 200
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     -1
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 3,
    "from": {
     "near": 9
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "B",
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 2,
    "from": {
     "near": 9
    }
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: down-B out of the run. The shine hits"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "The shine out of a run",
    "text": [
     "Fox does not have to stop to shine. Down and B pressed in a run start the shine on that frame, and it hits on its first frame: press it as he reaches {opp}.",
     "The run begins on frame 13 of the dash. In the 12 frames before it down and B do nothing: that close, jump and shine as Fox leaves the ground instead."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 200
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 3,
        "from": {
         "near": 9
        }
       },
       {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 2,
        "from": {
         "near": 9
        }
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: down-B out of the run. The shine hits"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "A target that moves",
    "text": [
     "{opp} dashes in and out and jumps. A shine aimed at where it stood when Fox set off misses.",
     "Run at it and press down and B when Fox is on top of it: its dash back is slower than his run, and the shine reaches a jump's first frames too."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 200
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 3,
        "from": {
         "near": 9
        }
       },
       {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 2,
        "from": {
         "near": 9
        }
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: down-B out of the run. The shine hits"
      }
     }
    }
   }
  ]
 },
